### List all mails across mailboxes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail?page=0&size=20 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get mail detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Mark mail as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Send an email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/send HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "cacc@arorms.cn",
  "subject": "Test email from HTTP Client",
  "content": "This is a test email sent by the JetBrains HTTP Client."
}

### Create a draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/draft HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "cacc@arorms.cn",
  "subject": "Draft test",
  "content": "This is a draft."
}

### Update a draft
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "cacc@arorms.cn",
  "subject": "Draft test (updated)",
  "content": "This draft has been updated."
}

### Delete a mail (moves to TRASH)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete a mail in TRASH (permanent delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}